{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12959","headline":"早发若岘驿望庐山 · 独孤及","name":"早发若岘驿望庐山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨罢山翠鲜，泠泠东风好。\n断崖云生处，是向峯顶道。\n谁谓峯顶远，跂予可瞻讨。\n忘缘祛天机，脱屐恨不早。\n祗恐岁云暮，遂与空名老。\n心往迹未幷，惭愧山上草。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12959.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12959","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}